      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 19 years 4 months ago",
      "body": "Lately I've had a really stressful time so yesterday I had a spur-of the moment idea to go away for a couple of nights to the Isle of Wight. I've asked my nan to come with the kids and I as dh has alot of work on this week. I'm really looking forward to it coz my nan and grandad always took me there when I was a kid and it'll be SOOO nice to not have to do the washing up and house work 😎  We're staying in a B&B on the sea-front so they'll be amusements and the beach and crazy golf(not sure about how safe that'll be with the kids though 🤔 )So we're going tuesday-thursday",
